{"ID":"20240902110148-ztvtcu2","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240902110148-ztvtcu2","title":"炮姜","type":"doc","updated":"20240902110633"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240902110202-ic7n2zh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110202-ic7n2zh","updated":"20240902110202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206083834-wnplhvl.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902110202-ooa1la9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110202-ooa1la9","updated":"20240902110202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"炮姜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/炮姜-20240205162634-4gv1qaj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902110218-s1yodgk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110218-s1yodgk","updated":"20240902110633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：炮姜就是干姜的炮制加工品；点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240504170632-ngk6rho","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"157干姜"}]},{"ID":"20240902110223-v8w16z4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902110223-v8w16z4"}},{"ID":"20240902110510-zxtmv5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-zxtmv5y","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：炮姜"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-z6wt4vb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-z6wt4vb","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮姜《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-mf95fxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-mf95fxl","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】PàoJiānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-x08rsnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-x08rsnh","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为干姜的炮制加工品。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-enefv6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-enefv6o","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈不规则膨胀的块状，具指状分枝。表面棕黑色或棕褐色。质轻泡，断面边缘处显棕黑色，中心棕黄色，细颗粒性，维管束散在。气香、特异，味微辛、辣。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-988vt42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-988vt42","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】本品粉末棕褐色。淀粉粒众多，卵圆形、椭圆形、三角状卵形、类圆形或不规则形，直径5～40μm，脐点点状，位于较小端，也有呈裂缝状者，层纹有的明显。偶见糊化淀粉粒团块。油细胞及树脂细胞散于薄壁组织中，内含淡黄色油滴或暗红棕色物质。纤维成束或散离，先端钝尖，少数分叉，有的一边呈波状或锯齿状，直径15～40μm,壁稍厚，非木化，具斜细纹孔，常可见菲薄的横隔。梯纹、螺纹及网纹导管多见，少数为环纹导管，直径15～70μm。导管或纤维旁有时可见内含暗红棕色物的管状细胞，直径12～20μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-9zpkjnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-9zpkjnq","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】取净干姜，照烫法（附录ⅡD）用沙烫至鼓起，表面棕褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-lgn24gk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-lgn24gk","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛、热。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-5fx1zev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-5fx1zev","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归脾、胃、肾、心、肺经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-4kktm7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-4kktm7q","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】温中散寒，温经止血。用于脾胃虚寒，腹痛吐泻，吐衄崩漏，阳虚失血。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-vkxakix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-vkxakix","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】3～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-ubgqhc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-ubgqhc4","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置阴凉干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-n7674w2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-n7674w2","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-dwbgjta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-dwbgjta","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮姜《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-jhofexz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-jhofexz","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】PàoJiānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-3fk3vc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-3fk3vc4","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】CommonGinger"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-6ssxb3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-6ssxb3j","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-kkbztx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-kkbztx0","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为姜科植物姜干燥根茎的炮制品。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-s5pk8r2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-s5pk8r2","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：ZingiberofficinaleRosc."}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-3xo4g9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-3xo4g9w","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：同干姜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-cyujafs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-cyujafs","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】姜，多年生草本，高50-80cm。根茎肥厚，断面黄白色，有浓厚的辛辣气味。叶互生，排成2列，无柄，几抱茎；叶舌长2-4mm；叶片披针形至线状披针形，长15-30cm，宽1.5-2.2cm，先端渐尖，基部狭，叶革鞘状抱茎，无毛。花葶自根茎中抽出，长15-25cm；穗状花序椭圆形，长4-5cm；苞片卵形，长约2.5cm，淡绿色，边缘淡黄色，先端有小尖头；花萼管长约1cm，具3短尖齿；花冠黄绿色，管长2-2.5cm，裂片3，披针形，长不及2cm，唇瓣的中间裂片长圆状倒卵开，较花冠裂片短，有紫色条纹和淡黄色斑点，两侧裂片卵形，黄绿色，具紫色边缘；雄蕊1，暗紫色，花药长约9m，药隔附属体包裹住花柱；子房3室，无毛，花柱1，柱头近球形。蒴果。种子多数，黑色。花期8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-e9cicab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-e9cicab","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】我国中部、东南部至西南部各少广为栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-cvzk3rg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-cvzk3rg","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-ib5reah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-ib5reah","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴定：本品呈不规则膨胀的块状，具指状分枝。表面棕黑色或棕褐色。质轻泡，断面边缘处显棕黑色，中心棕黄色，细颗粒性，维管束散在。气香特异，味微辛、辣。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-s9nfqij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-s9nfqij","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴定：本品粉末棕褐色。①淀粉粒众多，卵圆形、椭圆形、三角状卵形、类圆形或不规则形，直径5-40μm，脐点点状，位于较小端，也有呈裂缝状者，层纹有的明显。偶见糊化淀粉粒团块。②油细胞及树脂细胞散于薄壁组织中，内含淡黄色油滴或暗红棕色物质。③纤维成束或散离，先端钝尖，少数分叉，有的一边呈波状或锯齿状，直径15-40μm，壁稍厚，非木化，具斜细纹孔，常可见菲薄的横隔。④梯纹、螺纹及网纹导管多见，少数为环纹导管，直径15-70μm。导管或纤维旁有时可见内含暗红棕色物的管状细胞，直径12-20μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-0euupyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-0euupyj","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】温中散寒，温经止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-771kk6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-771kk6m","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】总灰分不得过70%（药典附录ⅨK）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-cjdbzlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-cjdbzlh","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】取净干姜，照烫法（附录ⅡD）用沙烫至鼓起，表面棕褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-wcvvnaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-wcvvnaj","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味苦；辛；性温"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-kqpcrfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-kqpcrfj","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】脾；胃；肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-nwnxau1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-nwnxau1","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】温中止泻；温经止血。主虚寒性脘腹疼痛；呕吐；泻痢；吐血；便血；崩漏"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-u9uixg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-u9uixg7","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3-6g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-ra4u8a0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-ra4u8a0","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】孕妇及阴虚有热者禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-xgdvxwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-xgdvxwq","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】用于脾胃虚寒，腹痛吐泻，吐衄崩漏，阳虚失血。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110510-ajzq0m9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110510-ajzq0m9","updated":"20240902110516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902110511-dlya7yt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902110511-dlya7yt","updated":"20240902110516"}},{"ID":"20240902110512-aiv2bs3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110512-aiv2bs3","updated":"20240902110516"}}]}